## Verification Plan
### Automated & Manual Verification
We will use the **Browser tool** or run a local server and verify using the following checklist:
1. Validate responsive layouts on Mobile, Tablet, and Desktop resolutions.
2. Verify all custom forms (reservations/pricing/consultations) have built-in validation.
3. Test all JavaScript interactions: slides, filter changes, and dynamic stats.
4. Ensure zero HTML/CSS/JS reference errors in the console.
